{"asset_key":"ep5/quest_story_15216320","episode":"ep5","category":"quest_story","story_id":"15216320","schema_version":1,"lang":"cn","texts":{"say:1:1521632001:0":{"text":"谢谢你们帮我找的石头。它很适合用来做墓碑。","source_cn":"谢谢你们帮我找的石头。它很适合用来做墓碑。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x106EF32A6382B391","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:2:1521632002:0":{"text":"请等我一会……我很快就能做完。","source_cn":"请等我一会……我很快就能做完。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xDFB470FC069E4E9E","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"narration:4:1521632003:0":{"text":"维尔纳沉默地在石头上敲敲打打，将它打磨成墓碑的形状。","source_cn":"维尔纳沉默地在石头上敲敲打打，将它打磨成墓碑的形状。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xE0A30A7CD77AA2A7","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"narration:5:1521632004:0":{"text":"最后，他在墓碑上刻下了“格雷格”这个名字，将它竖立在怪物消失的地方。","source_cn":"最后，他在墓碑上刻下了“格雷格”这个名字，将它竖立在怪...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x6A8171A6A5A7C160","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1521632005:0":{"text":"格雷格……这是我父亲的名字。","source_cn":"格雷格……这是我父亲的名字。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x8BCCC7C2D8F1D107","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_ti