个名字。我嫌弃它一点也不好听，朴素得像是一块未经雕刻的石头。","source_cn":"我曾经很抵触“老石艺”这个名字。我嫌弃它一点也不好听，...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x38DE2D1DC5236CC3","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:13:1521632012:0":{"text":"但刚刚，我看着老爹雕石头地样子，看着那些被划得乱七八糟的石头……我忽然想明白了很多事。","source_cn":"但刚刚，我看着老爹雕石头地样子，看着那些被划得乱七八糟...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x44A63DC86E8C8926","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:14:1521632013:0":{"text":"他以这个名字为傲……不是吗？","source_cn":"他以这个名字为傲……不是吗？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xF68667A821A98594","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:15:1521632014:0":{"text":"所以，我会继承“老石艺”这个名字。这样，如果有更多人知道我，那他们也会知道他……","source_cn":"所以，我会继承“老石艺”这个名字。这样，如果有更多人知...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xCFC72921EA81F26B","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:16:1521632015:0":{"text":"我的老爹……他是世界上最好的石匠。","source_cn":"我的老爹……他是世界上最好的石匠。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xAB89159B6909E032","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice:10:0:1":{"text":"现在这个名字会留在这里","source_cn":"现在这个名字会留在这里","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0xD3